[00:22.82] Unfaithful servant, you don't have to say you're sorry
[00:32.58] If you done it just for the spite
[00:37.20] Or did you do it just for the glory?
[00:42.26] Like a stranger you turned your back
[00:46.78] Left your keep and gone to pack
[00:51.52] Bear in mind who's to blame for all the shame
[00:57.22] She really cared, the time she spared and the home you shared
[01:04.96] Unfaithful servant, I can hear the whistle blowin'
